んだ！？ボーっとしてるんですか! あの魔女捕まえて殺せ！お前らの知ってるの彼女はもういないんだ！」\n\n＊＊トワは魔女に裏切られたのです。怒りと恐怖に満ちた声で話声お願いします。\n＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿\n\nI'm sorry if this is too complicated, if the amount is too low, please feel free to reject and appeal with an amount you think appropriate. Thank you so much for your consideration!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@woool1029/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 136140, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/e930a4e1-d4ba-46cd-b89c-1b541f9f03a1?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1780460808&Signature=ipDagDyx~Q4G3T6zyjMV45kUMoS7knFRrLqF1Dz9eTFMtDr~fKlamMeYDyBq5vB-v33WO6tGuiLphj0Osyg~vZ~5DV2BhCvRLNPvKJmonikzGxJ07MHd4FbEFv8lhnD5N7wYOgBk6Loh~z8bXcS9EZRKbgK92X4LpTegrakSGn4HrL8nWlHphxahX7z9CKgm-wUCjb6Jm~qE19WAMcG8kHqDuyDzPGX4oCV~FieZKlvik2lgR13UDhV9zXPxgnrYZQ~U8y6sp6tRIBjEm8wqY3ejY71twobMYg0T1Jts~p0ZXMXj-Ox1HacEbX18lSVw3HKhX3joFiwhZwMu5KUj9g__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=496aa1eafd2672ec9cf9225f13a2f027", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=496aa1eafd2672ec9cf9225f13a2f027, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d081bd0b41a2d8c1513f7d350f82192 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e420d040323801b1e0e94cbba5f9e33 3x"}, "preview_ur